    <name>opencode-ensemble</name>
    <description>Use when coordinating multiple coding agents, delegating independent software work, managing OpenCode Ensemble teams, choosing teammate profiles or models, reusing native session history, handing a session to another agent, or reviewing teammate output. Also use to decide whether a team is worthwhile. Project installation and agent-file adaptation use ensemble-project-setup.</description>
  </skill>
</available_skills>
